{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2016-04", "window": 3, "start_date": 1460764800, "end_date": 1461369599, "month_true_total": 139, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:11:26 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "22570204", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049097610", "personaname": "Sunday Funday", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/0111010000000000/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 3218, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3070, "last_played": 1637855076, "avatar": "31808203e6f45edf38aba5d01ec81b7419e24087"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain, alongside Spelunky, the Binding of Isaac and FTL were singlehandedly the reason why roguelites became popular in mainstream video gaming. \n\nRisk of Rain offers a lot more than just it's legacy though:\nBeautiful pixel art,\ndiverse and varied characters,\ntons of items and synergies, \na timer that increases difficulty over time,\nonline and local co-op,\nand an amazing soundtrack.\n\nIt does however suffer from a high entry difficulty ( like the Souls games) which is easily over come but it might discourage those who it catches unaware.", "timestamp_created": 1461342312, "timestamp_updated": 1461347331, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502487540245056152", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "22560134", "author": {"steamid": "76561198158611533", "personaname": "Zach", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198158611533/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 11597, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1547, "last_played": 1771520753, "avatar"